}
```

**Outcome**:
- **User Experience**: Seamless authentication for low-risk access; step-up MFA only for high-risk scenarios (2% of logins)
- **Offline Capability**: Members can access cached health data offline with device-level encryption
- **Privacy Protection**: Purpose-of-use validation ensures data access aligns with member intent
- **Compliance**: CMS Interoperability Rule compliance; HIPAA minimum necessary access

